<title>USA: Taubman Centers Inc Q4 net falls.</title>
<headline>Taubman Centers Inc Q4 net falls.</headline>
<dateline>BLOOMFIELD HILLS, Mich. 1997-02-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>1996			1995</p>
<p> Net/Shr		    $0.13		    $0.30</p>
<p> Oper Funds/Shr	    0.27		     0.25</p>
<p> Net			  6,052		   13,431</p>
<p> Oper Funds		12,065		   10,832</p>
<p> Avg shrs diluted	45,464		   44,156</p>
<p>(All data above 000s except per share numbers)</p>
<p>NOTE: 1995 Q4 includes extraordinary gain of $6.6 million from disposition of Bellevue Center.</p>
<p>		 YEAR</p>
<p> Net/Shr		    $0.46		    $0.57</p>
<p> Oper Funds/Shr	    0.99		     0.92</p>
