<p> Oper Funds		44,104		   40,798</p>
<p> Avg shrs primary	44,445		   44,250</p>
<p>(All data above 000s except per share numbers)</p>
<p>NOTE: 1996 year includes extraordinary charges of $444,000 from early extinguishment of debt of Taubman Realty Group Limited Partnership, versus year-earlier net gain of $5.8 million, consisting of gain from Bellevue Center disposition offset by debt-related charges.</p>
